    "title": "Four-alarm fire displaces families in Ossining - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n14 hours ago OSSINING, NY — A four-alarm fire at an apartment complex Friday night displaced 16 families but resulted in no injuries, according to the Ossining Fire Department. The fire broke out at Parth Knolls, a 24-unit building standing three stories in height, with 16 of those units occupied at the time of the incident. Read full article\n1",
